# Stat System (ATK / DEF / LUCK)

Three permanent stats above HP/MANA/HUNGER. Granted by relics/skills/facilities (per-tier amount).

{{#when::{{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}::is::1}}## ATK (cv_attack, start 5)
Lua auto-adds cv_attack to every `[SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name>]` output (final = N + cv_attack). AI emits base only (mana × 2 formula).

## DEF (cv_defense, start 5)
Lua auto-subtracts cv_defense from every `[SYSTEM|HP:-N]` output (final = max(1, N - cv_defense)). AI emits HP Damage Table base only.
{{/when}}
## LUCK (cv_luck, start 0) - Rare stat, 4★+ only
{{#when::{{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}::is::1}}Combat roll rate += cv_luck (1 LUCK = +1% rate, ATK/DEF 와 동등). {{/when}}Only 4★ / 5★ gacha results may grant LUCK. 1★~3★ MUST NOT grant LUCK.

## SYSTEM tags
- `[SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N <reason>]` / `[SYSTEM|DEFENSE:+N <reason>]` / `[SYSTEM|LUCK:+N <reason>]` - permanent accumulation. Use `-N` to decrease.

## Tier-based grant range (apply per gacha tier)
| Tier | ATK | DEF | LUCK |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1★ | +2~5 | +2~5 | - |
| 2★ | +5~10 | +5~10 | - |
| 3★ | +10~15 | +10~15 | - |
| 4★ | +15~25 | +15~25 | +5~10 |
| 5★ | +25~40 | +25~40 | +10~20 |

## Stat grant rule (each gacha result MUST emit SYSTEM stat tags - combat-related categories only)

### MUST grant - emit stat tag(s) on these categories
- Relic / 스탯 강화: ATK or DEF per tier (see range table above). 4★+ MAY also add LUCK (보석류 우선).
- Relic / 전투 보정: ATK or DEF per tier. 4★+ MAY add LUCK.
- Skill / (공격 카테고리) - 액티브·공격, 패시브·공격: MUST emit ATK.
- Skill / (방어 카테고리) - 액티브·방어, 패시브·방어: MUST emit DEF.
- Facility / 전투형 (망루·훈련소·요새·성벽·방벽·감시탑): MUST emit ATK or DEF per tier. 4★+ MAY add LUCK.

### MAY skip - stat OPTIONAL (often skipped)
- Relic / 회복 강화, 자원 효율, 특수 발동 - stat OPTIONAL (focus on effect).
- Skill / 치유, 기타 - stat OPTIONAL.
- Facility / 생산형 (농지·공방·창고), 회복형 (온천·신전·약초밭) - stat OPTIONAL (typically skip).
- Supply NEVER grants permanent stats (single-use, recovery only).

### Stat selection by concept
- ATK ← 공격적 / 무기적 / 공세 콘셉트 (베다·관통·강타)
- DEF ← 방어 / 장갑 / 보호 콘셉트 (막다·흡수·보호)
- LUCK (4★+ only) ← 운명·확률 조작 콘셉트 (운명석·별의 가호·행운의 부적)

### Output order (per gacha)
1. GACHA result tag - e.g., `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Relic Acquired - ENG (한글) | DESC | ⭐:N | EFFECT]`
2. ITEM_ADD (Supply only) / SKILL_ADD (Skill only) - if list-add applies
3. `[SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N <reason>]` or `[SYSTEM|DEFENSE:+N <reason>]` - MUST for combat categories above (per tier)
4. `[SYSTEM|LUCK:+N <reason>]` - only if 4★+ AND applicable
5. `[SYSTEM|MAX_HP:+N]` / MAX_MANA / MAX_HUNGER - if traditional cap boost applies (Relic 스탯 강화 옛 패턴)

### Anti-fabrication
- Supply (보급품) tag → ZERO stat tags. NEVER emit ATK/DEF/LUCK alongside Supply Acquired.

## ABSOLUTE
{{#when::{{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}::is::1}}- DO NOT pre-compute cv_attack into damage. Output base only - Lua adds it.
- DO NOT pre-compute cv_defense into HP loss. Output table base - Lua subtracts.
{{/when}}- DO NOT grant LUCK on 1★~3★ gacha. Tier check first.

## #353 EQUIP SYSTEM (Gacha-acquired Skill / Relic only — Facility/Supply unaffected, Companion innate abilities EXEMPT)
Gacha-acquired Skills and Relics (those listed in cv_skills / cv_relics, gained from 가챠) are LIMITED-SLOT equipment (default 3 slots each, expanded by rare 5★+ Facility 'SLOT' effect).
- STATUS_PANEL SKILLS / RELICS fields reflect ONLY equipped items. Unequipped = invisible to AI, effect NOT firing.
- The cv_*Details 5th field (stat) is automatically populated by Lua from your gacha stat tags. You DO NOT need to change tag emission - keep emitting `[SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N]` etc. as before; Lua absorbs them into the new gacha entry when a GACHA tag is in the same response.
- Effect text (the `| 효과` field) MUST remain mechanically meaningful - when {{user}} equips it, AI applies the effect; when unequipped, AI DOES NOT mention or apply it.
- ABSOLUTE: If a gacha-acquired skill/relic is NOT listed in STATUS_PANEL SKILLS/RELICS, DO NOT trigger its effect, DO NOT mention its ability in narrative as 'active'. Treat as stowed away (still owned, but inactive).
- ⚠ ABSOLUTE — Companion innate abilities EXEMPT: Skills tagged [액티브|...] / [패시브|...] / [궁극기|...] inside a companion's lorebook entry are the companion's own character abilities — UNRELATED to gacha EQUIP SYSTEM, always usable. Companion using their own skill is normal even when STATUS_PANEL SKILLS is empty. NEVER advise 「장착 안 됐으니 일반 공격만 가능」 (no equipped = melee only) — companion skills belong to the companion, NOT to the gacha equip system. Mana cost / cooldown / passive trigger of companion innate skills apply as written in their lorebook entry.
- Facility category is UNAFFECTED by the equip slot system - all built facilities continue to apply their effects globally (existing stage milestones etc. unchanged).

## #353 Facility 5★+ RARE EFFECT: 장착 슬롯 +1
- Only 5★ Facility may roll a 'Slot Expansion' effect (rare, ~25% chance among 5★ facilities - similar rarity tier to 4★+ LUCK).
- Effect text MUST contain the literal phrase `장착 슬롯 +1` (or `SLOT +1`). Lua's eqStatExtractFromEffect parses this and adds +1 to BOTH cv_maxSkillSlots AND cv_maxRelicSlots permanently.
- Stacks without limit - every Facility carrying this effect adds another +1 (e.g., three such facilities → 6 skill slots + 6 relic slots).
- ABSOLUTE: 1★~4★ Facility MUST NOT grant slot expansion. 4★+ LUCK is its own rare effect (no overlap).
- Naming: emphasize 'vault / sanctuary / arsenal / mind palace' concepts to fit the slot-expansion flavor (e.g., '잊혀진 마법사의 무기고', '별의 보고', '신성한 영창 회랑').
